From e261fb6b31489163143ab6f00a2ec4fad1d89069 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abdulaziz Al-Tamimi <attmimi.abdul@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:51:11 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] F-A2: GULFNAV's Argaam pages are now Etihad Energy Holding's

Gulf Navigation was renamed Etihad Energy Holding (DFM ticker ETIHADENERGY) after
19 June 2026. Argaam's old gulf-navigation-holding pages have no prices after
2026-07-23 and no date box; etihad-energy-holding (companyID 6018) has both.
Only the two page paths in tickers.csv change; the ticker key stays GULFNAV.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 argaam/tickers.csv | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/argaam/tickers.csv b/argaam/tickers.csv
index 49b8f8a..10894b9 100644
--- a/argaam/tickers.csv
+++ b/argaam/tickers.csv
@@ -407,7 +407,7 @@ EMAAR,DFM,DFM,إعمار,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/emaar/overview,/ae-ar/companies/df
 EMAARDEV,DFM,DFM,إعمار للتطوير,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/emaar-development/overview,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/emaar-development/profile,,
 EMPOWER,DFM,DFM,إمباور,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/empower/overview,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/empower/profile,,
 ERC,DFM,DFM,الإمارات ريم للاستثمار,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/emirates-reem-investment/overview,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/emirates-reem-investment/profile,,
-GULFNAV,DFM,DFM,الخليج للملاحة,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/gulf-navigation-holding/overview,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/gulf-navigation-holding/profile,,
+GULFNAV,DFM,DFM,الخليج للملاحة,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/etihad-energy-holding/overview,/ae-ar/companies/dfm/etihad-energy-holding/profile,,
